# Example crontab for BONE in batch mode (alternative to --watch +
# systemd).  Edit paths to match your install.
#
# Install with: crontab docs/deploy/crontab.example

# Every 10 minutes: fetch new mail, digest, expire, then refresh
# the static exports and send any due notification emails.
*/10 * * * * cd /opt/bone && clj -M:run >> logs/cron.log 2>&1 && bb export >> logs/cron.log 2>&1 && bb notify >> logs/cron.log 2>&1

# Once a week: purge orphan emails older than 90 days.
# 5 3 * * 0 cd /opt/bone && bb maintenance --delete >> logs/maint.log 2>&1
